{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WBdZae2VdcJtj28jZFHS8G","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 fully supported: canary→diversity lead 1-2 gen, robust\n2\t  across seeds. Claim 2 softened to regime-dependent gradient: canary→perplexity lead\n3\t  only at α=0.25, marginal, phase boundary is a gradual degradation zone around α∈[0.25,0.5]\n4\t  rather than a sharp transition. Claim 3 softened: TY overturns 15-29% naive associations\n5\t  — useful methodological contribution but not dramatic. Intervention (plan_007) needed\n6\t  to strengthen practical narrative. Target AAAI with honest framing; prepare EMNLP\n7\t  Findings fallback.\n8\t\n9\t  '\n10\timagined_experiments:\n11\t- name: α-sweep predictability phase diagram\n12\t  plan_id: plan_001\n13\t  description: 'Pythia-410M × WikiText-103 × α∈{0.25, 0.50, 0.75} × 10 gen × 3 seeds.\n14\t    Run Toda-Yamamoto panel temporal precedence for all canary→target pairs at each\n15\t    α.\n16\t\n17\t    '\n18\t  expected_results:\n19\t    alpha_025_canary_diversity_lead_gen: 2.0\n20\t    alpha_025_canary_diversity_TY_pval_median: 0.003\n21\t    alpha_025_canary_diversity_seeds_significant: 3/3\n22\t    alpha_025_canary_perplexity_lead_gen: 1.0\n23\t    alpha_025_canary_perplexity_TY_pval_median: 0.042\n24\t    alpha_025_canary_perplexity_seeds_significant: 2/3\n25\t    alpha_025_gen10_perplexity: 78.5\n26\t    alpha_025_gen10_distinct_1: 0.142\n27\t    alpha_025_gen10_token_entropy: 2.61\n28\t    alpha_025_gen10_ece: 0.089\n29\t    alpha_050_canary_diversity_lead_gen: 1.0\n30\t    alpha_050_canary_diversity_TY_pval_median: 0.008\n31\t    alpha_050_canary_diversity_seeds_significant: 3/3\n32\t    alpha_050_canary_perplexity_lead_gen: 0.0\n33\t    alpha_050_canary_perplexity_TY_pval_median: 0.31\n34\t    alpha_050_canary_perplexity_seeds_significant: 0/3\n35\t    alpha_050_gen10_perplexity: 185.3\n36\t    alpha_050_gen10_distinct_1: 0.108\n37\t    alpha_050_gen10_token_entropy: 2.18\n38\t    alpha_050_gen10_ece: 0.167\n39\t    alpha_075_canary_diversity_lead_gen: 1.0\n40\t    alpha_075_canary_diversity_TY_pval_median: 0.017\n41\t    alpha_075_canary_diversity_seeds_significant: 3/3\n42\t    alpha_075_canary_perplexity_lead_gen: 0.0\n43\t    alpha_075_canary_perplexity_TY_pval_median: 0.58\n44\t    alpha_075_canary_perplexity_seeds_significant: 0/3\n45\t    alpha_075_gen10_perplexity: 512.7\n46\t    alpha_075_gen10_distinct_1: 0.083\n47\t    alpha_075_gen10_token_entropy: 1.68\n48\t    alpha_075_gen10_ece: 0.312\n49\t    effective_rank_lead_any_alpha: not significant\n50\t    self_bleu_lead_any_alpha: not significant\n51\t  result_rationale: 'α=0.25 保留 75% 真实数据，collapse 进程最慢。diversity 退化需要更多代数积累才显现， 给 canary（ECE/entropy\n52\t    对分布偏移更敏感）提供 2 gen 的领先窗口。perplexity 在此 regime 下也是渐进恶化而非突变，canary 有机会以 ~1 gen 领先，但效应弱——因为\n53\t    75% 真实数据的 锚定效应使 perplexity 变化幅度小，信噪比低，仅 2/3 seeds 达到显著。 α=0.50 是过渡区：collapse 加速，canary→diversity\n54\t    仍有 1 gen lead（diversity 指标的 累积性质使其滞后于 distributional shift），但 perplexity 开始与 canary\n55\t    近同步恶化， TY 无法分离 temporal precedence。 α=0.75 接近 full SC：collapse 动力学加速到 canary 和\n56\t    diversity 几乎同代恶化，仅因 diversity 的定义性滞后保留 1 gen lead；perplexity 与 canary 完全同步崩溃。\n57\t    effective_rank 和 self_bleu 在所有 α 下均无显著 lead——与 MVP 一致，这两个指标要么 噪声太大（self_bleu 的\n58\t    sampling variance），要么对 synthetic data drift 不够敏感 （effective_rank 在 embedding space\n59\t    退化前不变化）。\n60\t\n61\t    '\n62\t  tables:\n63\t  - name: 'Table 2: Toda-Yamamoto lead-lag results across α'\n64\t    columns:\n65\t    - α\n66\t    - canary_family\n67\t    - target\n68\t    - TY_lead_gen\n69\t    - TY_p_median\n70\t    - seeds_sig\n71\t    - effect_size_r\n72\t    rows:\n73\t    - - 0.25\n74\t      - ECE\n75\t      - distinct_1\n76\t      - 2\n77\t      - 0.002\n78\t      - 3/3\n79\t      - 0.93\n80\t    - - 0.25\n81\t      - token_entropy\n82\t      - distinct_1\n83\t      - 2\n84\t      - 0.004\n85\t      - 3/3\n86\t      - 0.91\n87\t    - - 0.25\n88\t      - ECE\n89\t      - perplexity\n90\t      - 1\n91\t      - 0.038\n92\t      - 2/3\n93\t      - 0.72\n94\t    - - 0.25\n95\t      - token_entropy\n96\t      - perplexity\n97\t      - 1\n98\t      - 0.047\n99\t      - 2/3\n100\t      - 0.68\n101\t    - - 0.5\n102\t      - ECE\n103\t      - distinct_1\n104\t      - 1\n105\t      - 0.006\n106\t      - 3/3\n107\t      - 0.9\n108\t    - - 0.5\n109\t      - token_entropy\n110\t      - distinct_1\n111\t      - 1\n112\t      - 0.01\n113\t      - 3/3\n114\t      - 0.88\n115\t    - - 0.5\n116\t      - ECE\n117\t      - perplexity\n118\t      - 0\n119\t      - 0.28\n120\t      - 0/3\n121\t      - 0.31\n122\t    - - 0.5\n123\t      - token_entropy\n124\t      - perplexity\n125\t      - 0\n126\t      - 0.35\n127\t      - 0/3\n128\t      - 0.25\n129\t    - - 0.75\n130\t      - ECE\n131\t      - distinct_1\n132\t      - 1\n133\t      - 0.014\n134\t      - 3/3\n135\t      - 0.89\n136\t    - - 0.75\n137\t      - token_entropy\n138\t      - distinct_1\n139\t      - 1\n140\t      - 0.019\n141\t      - 3/3\n142\t      - 0.88\n143\t    - - 0.75\n144\t      - ECE\n145\t      - perplexity\n146\t      - 0\n147\t      - 0.52\n148\t      - 0/3\n149\t      - 0.14\n150\t    - - 0.75\n151\t      - token_entropy\n152\t      - perplexity\n153\t      - 0\n154\t      - 0.63\n155\t      - 0/3\n156\t      - 0.09\n157\t  - name: 'Table S1: Failed canary families across α'\n158\t    columns:\n159\t    - α\n160\t    - canary_family\n161\t    - target\n162\t    - TY_p_median\n163\t    - failure_reason\n164\t    rows:\n165\t    - - 0.25\n166\t      - effective_rank\n167\t      - distinct_1\n168\t      - 0.41\n169\t      - rank plateau until gen 6-7\n170\t    - - 0.25\n171\t      - self_bleu\n172\t      - distinct_1\n173\t      - 0.55\n174\t      - high sampling variance\n175\t    - - 0.5\n176\t      - effective_rank\n177\t      - distinct_1\n178\t      - 0.38\n179\t      - rank plateau until gen 5\n180\t    - - 0.5\n181\t      - self_bleu\n182\t      - distinct_1\n183\t      - 0.62\n184\t      - high sampling variance\n185\t    - - 0.75\n186\t      - effective_rank\n187\t      - distinct_1\n188\t      - 0.29\n189\t      - noisy but borderline\n190\t    - - 0.75\n191\t      - self_bleu\n192\t      - distinct_1\n193\t      - 0.48\n194\t      - sampling variance + floor effect\n195\t  figures_description:\n196\t  - 'Fig 2: Predictability phase diagram. X-axis: α (0.25–1.0). Y-axis: TY-estimated\n197\t    lead (gen). 两条曲线: canary→diversity (从 2 gen 单调降至 ~1 gen) 和 canary→perplexity (从\n198\t    ~1 gen 降至 0). 灰色 shading 标注 ''predictable zone'' (α<0.5) vs ''synchronous collapse\n199\t    zone'' (α>0.5). Boundary 是渐变带而非 sharp line.'\n200\t  - 'Fig 3: Per-α metric trajectories. 3×2 panel (3 α × 2 targets). 每个 panel 叠加 ECE\n201\t    (red), token_entropy (blue), distinct_1 (black dashed). 可视化 lead 如何随 α 收缩.'\n202\t  - 'Fig S1: Per-seed scatter for α=0.25 canary→perplexity, showing 2/3 seeds significant,\n203\t    1 seed nonsignificant (p=0.11).'\n204\t  analysis: 'Phase diagram 的核心发现：canary→diversity lead 是 monotonically decreasing\n205\t    function of α, 从 α=0.25 的 2 gen 到 α=0.75/1.0 的 ~1 gen。这意味着 early warning window\n206\t    随 contamination ratio 缩短但不消失——即使在 α=0.75 仍有 1 gen lead for diversity。 canary→perplexity\n207\t    的 boundary 在 α≈0.25-0.50 之间：仅在 α=0.25 可检测到 marginal lead， 且 cross-seed consistency\n208\t    仅 2/3。这定义了 phase diagram 的 \"partially predictable\" 区域。 narrative: \"we map the\n209\t    boundary of predictability\" 而非 \"we show canaries predict collapse\"。\n210\t\n211\t    '\n212\t- name: '方法论 ablation: naive correlation vs Toda-Yamamoto'\n213\t  plan_id: plan_002\n214\t  description: '在 MVP 4-seed (α=1.0) + plan_001 α-sweep 数据上，对比四种方法: (i) naive Pearson\n215\t    lag-correlation, (ii) 差分后 cross-correlation, (iii) threshold-based lead time (2σ\n216\t    onset), (iv) Toda-Yamamoto panel temporal precedence. 量化各方法的 Type I error rate\n217\t    和伪显著比例。\n218\t\n219\t    '\n220\t  expected_results:\n221\t    total_pairwise_associations_tested: 96\n222\t    naive_pearson_significant_count: 71\n223\t    differenced_xcorr_significant_count: 52\n224\t    threshold_2sigma_significant_count: 58\n225\t    TY_significant_count: 54\n226\t    naive_overturned_by_TY_count: 19\n227\t    naive_overturned_by_TY_pct: 20.0\n228\t    naive_only_significant_examples: effective_rank→distinct_1 (α=0.75), self_bleu→perplexity\n229\t      (α=0.50), ECE→perplexity (α=0.50)\n230\t    TY_and_differenced_agree_pct: 85.0\n231\t    threshold_vs_TY_concordance_pct: 78.0\n232\t  result_rationale: 'Naive Pearson correlation 在非平稳时间序列上 inflate Type I error，因为两个共同趋势\n233\t    的序列（如都单调恶化的指标）即使无因果关系也会产生高相关。在 α=1.0 (MVP) 数据中， 所有指标都单调恶化，naive 方法会将几乎所有 pair\n234\t    标记为显著。在 α=0.50/0.75 中， 部分指标（如 effective_rank）前期平台后期骤降，与 diversity 的单调下降产生虚假的 lag\n235\t    correlation。 TY 通过在 VAR 中加入额外 lag 吸收非平稳性，只检测 Granger-causal temporal precedence。\n236\t    预计 ~20% 的 naive 显著关联被推翻——主要是 (1) failed canary families (effective_rank, self_bleu)\n237\t    的虚假显著, (2) canary→perplexity 在 α≥0.50 的虚假显著。 20% 而非更高，因为 canary→diversity 的 lead\n238\t    是 genuine 的（即使 naive 也能捕捉）， 所以大部分真阳性在两种方法下一致。差分法与 TY 85% 一致因为差分也处理了一阶非平稳， 但 TY\n239\t    对高阶整合更 robust。\n240\t\n241\t    '\n242\t  tables:\n243\t  - name: 'Table 3: Method comparison — significance rates'\n244\t    columns:\n245\t    - Method\n246\t    - Significant_pairs\n247\t    - Total_pairs\n248\t    - Rate\n249\t    - Overturned_by_TY\n250\t    rows:\n251\t    - - Naive Pearson\n252\t      - 71\n253\t      - 96\n254\t      - 74.0%\n255\t      - 19 (20%)\n256\t    - - Differenced XCorr\n257\t      - 52\n258\t      - 96\n259\t      - 54.2%\n260\t      - 3 (3%)\n261\t    - - Threshold (2σ)\n262\t      - 58\n263\t      - 96\n264\t      - 60.4%\n265\t      - 8 (8%)\n266\t    - - Toda-Yamamoto\n267\t      - 54\n268\t      - 96\n269\t      - 56.3%\n270\t      - —\n271\t  - name: 'Table 4: Overturned associations breakdown'\n272\t    columns:\n273\t    - canary_family\n274\t    - target\n275\t    - α\n276\t    - naive_p\n277\t    - TY_p\n278\t    - diagnosis\n279\t    rows:\n280\t    - - effective_rank\n281\t      - distinct_1\n282\t      - 0.75\n283\t      - 0.008\n284\t      - 0.29\n285\t      - 'spurious: co-trending'\n286\t    - - effective_rank\n287\t      - distinct_2\n288\t      - 0.5\n289\t      - 0.012\n290\t      - 0.38\n291\t      - 'spurious: co-trending'\n292\t    - - self_bleu\n293\t      - perplexity\n294\t      - 0.5\n295\t      - 0.015\n296\t      - 0.55\n297\t      - 'spurious: shared nonstationary trend'\n298\t    - - self_bleu\n299\t      - distinct_1\n300\t      - 0.75\n301\t      - 0.021\n302\t      - 0.48\n303\t      - 'spurious: variance-driven'\n304\t    - - ECE\n305\t      - perplexity\n306\t      - 0.5\n307\t      - 0.031\n308\t      - 0.28\n309\t      - 'spurious: co-trending without lead'\n310\t    - - token_entropy\n311\t      - perplexity\n312\t      - 0.5\n313\t      - 0.034\n314\t      - 0.35\n315\t      - 'spurious: co-trending without lead'\n316\t  figures_description:\n317\t  - 'Fig 4: Bar chart. 每个 method 的 significant pair 数量，colored by genuine (TY-confirmed)\n318\t    vs overturned. 直观展示 naive inflation.'\n319\t  - 'Fig S2: Heatmap. 4 methods × 24 canary-target-α combinations. Cell color = p-value.\n320\t    突出 naive 与 TY 不一致的 cells.'\n321\t  analysis: '20% overturned rate 证明 naive correlation 在非平稳训练指标上不可靠，但不是灾难性的。 方法论贡献的叙事：TY\n322\t    提供 \"more conservative but reliable\" 估计，特别在 failed canary families 上避免了误导性结论。如果直接用\n323\t    naive correlation 写论文，会错误声称 effective_rank 和 self_bleu 也是 viable canaries。这足以作为\n324\t    methodological contribution 但不应过分渲染。\n325\t\n326\t    '\n327\t- name: MVP 结果 formalization (max_lag=7)\n328\t  plan_id: plan_003\n329\t  description: '在 MVP 4-seed 100% SC 数据上，max_lag 从 5 增大到 7，重跑 TY 检验。 确认 ECE/token_entropy→diversity\n330\t    的 lead time 精确值。 用 2σ signal onset 定义交叉验证。\n331\t\n332\t    '\n333\t  expected_results:\n334\t    ECE_to_distinct1_lead_maxlag5: 1\n335\t    ECE_to_distinct1_lead_maxlag7: 1\n336\t    token_entropy_to_distinct1_lead_maxlag5: 1\n337\t    token_entropy_to_distinct1_lead_maxlag7: 2\n338\t    ECE_to_distinct2_lead_maxlag7: 1\n339\t    token_entropy_to_distinct2_lead_maxlag7: 1\n340\t    ECE_to_perplexity_lead_maxlag7: 0\n341\t    truncation_artifact_detected: partial — token_entropy→distinct_1 增加 1 gen at maxlag=7\n342\t    cross_seed_consistency_maxlag7: 4/4 for ECE→distinct_1; 3/4 for token_entropy→distinct_1\n343\t      at lag=2\n344\t    effect_size_r_ECE_distinct1: 0.94\n345\t    effect_size_r_token_entropy_distinct1: 0.91\n346\t    signal_onset_2sigma_ECE_gen: 2.0\n347\t    signal_onset_2sigma_distinct1_gen: 3.5\n348\t    signal_onset_2sigma_perplexity_gen: 2.0\n349\t  result_rationale: '在 α=1.0 (100% SC) 下，collapse 进程快速：10 gen 的 time series 很短，max_lag=5\n350\t    消耗大量自由度。增大到 max_lag=7 后，token_entropy→distinct_1 的 lead 从 1 增到 2 gen ——说明 max_lag=5\n351\t    确实存在 mild truncation。但 ECE→distinct_1 不变（lag=1），因为 ECE 的响应更即时（calibration error\n352\t    在 distribution shift 第一代就跳变）。 canary→perplexity 在 max_lag=7 下仍无显著 lead (lag=0)，确认\n353\t    100% SC 下 perplexity 与 canary 同步崩溃不是截断伪影而是 genuine 同步性。 2σ onset 分析显示 ECE 在 gen\n354\t    2 就超出 baseline 2σ，distinct_1 在 gen 3-4 才 显著偏离——视觉上也能看出 ~1.5 gen lead，与 TY 的 1-2\n355\t    gen 一致。\n356\t\n357\t    '\n358\t  tables:\n359\t  - name: 'Table 1: MVP lead-lag summary (max_lag=7)'\n360\t    columns:\n361\t    - canary\n362\t    - target\n363\t    - TY_lead_gen\n364\t    - p_value_median\n365\t    - seeds_sig\n366\t    - effect_r\n367\t    - truncation_vs_lag5\n368\t    rows:\n369\t    - - ECE\n370\t      - distinct_1\n371\t      - 1\n372\t      - 0.001\n373\t      - 4/4\n374\t      - 0.94\n375\t      - unchanged\n376\t    - - ECE\n377\t      - distinct_2\n378\t      - 1\n379\t      - 0.002\n380\t      - 4/4\n381\t      - 0.92\n382\t      - unchanged\n383\t    - - token_entropy\n384\t      - distinct_1\n385\t      - 2\n386\t      - 0.003\n387\t      - 3/4\n388\t      - 0.91\n389\t      - +1 gen (was 1)\n390\t    - - token_entropy\n391\t      - distinct_2\n392\t      - 1\n393\t      - 0.004\n394\t      - 4/4\n395\t      - 0.9\n396\t      - unchanged\n397\t    - - ECE\n398\t      - perplexity\n399\t      - 0\n400\t      - 0.48\n401\t      - 0/4\n402\t      - 0.12\n403\t      - unchanged\n404\t    - - token_entropy\n405\t      - perplexity\n406\t      - 0\n407\t      - 0.55\n408\t      - 0/4\n409\t      - 0.08\n410\t      - unchanged\n411\t    - - effective_rank\n412\t      - distinct_1\n413\t      - —\n414\t      - 0.37\n415\t      - 0/4\n416\t      - —\n417\t      - —\n418\t    - - self_bleu\n419\t      - distinct_1\n420\t      - —\n421\t      - 0.61\n422\t      - 0/4\n423\t      - —\n424\t      - —\n425\t  figures_description:\n426\t  - 'Fig 1: 4-seed overlay of ECE, token_entropy, distinct_1, distinct_2, perplexity\n427\t    over 10 gen (α=1.0). Error bands = ±1σ across seeds. Vertical dashed lines mark\n428\t    2σ onset for each metric. Visual lead ~1-2 gen for canary→diversity.'\n429\t  - 'Fig S3: max_lag sensitivity plot. X-axis: max_lag (3–7). Y-axis: TY-estimated\n430\t    lead. 每条线一个 canary-target pair. 展示 token_entropy→distinct_1 在 lag=5→7 时 lead 增加.'\n431\t  analysis: 'Truncation 效应存在但 mild：仅影响 token_entropy→distinct_1 一个 pair (+1 gen)。\n432\t    核心结论不变：ECE 和 token_entropy lead diversity 1-2 gen，不 lead perplexity。 建议主文报告 max_lag=7\n433\t    结果，附录给出 sensitivity analysis。\n434\t\n435\t    '\n436\t- name: C4 cross-domain validation\n437\t  plan_id: plan_004\n438\t  description: 'Pythia-410M × C4 × α=0.50 × 3 seeds × 10 gen. 验证 canary ranking (ECE\n439\t    > token_entropy > failed families) 是否跨域保持, 以及 lead time 是否缩短。\n440\t\n441\t    '\n442\t  expected_results:\n443\t    canary_ranking_preserved: true\n444\t    ECE_to_distinct1_lead_gen: 1.0\n445\t    token_entropy_to_distinct1_lead_gen: 1.0\n446\t    ECE_to_distinct1_TY_pval_median: 0.012\n447\t    seeds_significant_ECE_distinct1: 3/3\n448\t    ECE_to_perplexity_lead_gen: 0.0\n449\t    gen10_perplexity_C4: 210.5\n450\t    gen10_distinct_1_C4: 0.098\n451\t    collapse_speed_vs_wiki: slightly faster\n452\t    lead_time_vs_wiki_alpha050: same (1 gen) or shorter\n453\t    effect_size_r_ECE_distinct1: 0.88\n454\t  result_rationale: 'C4 比 WikiText-103 更多样（web crawl vs curated Wikipedia），但 Pythia\n455\t    在 the Pile 上预训练（包含部分 web text），所以 C4 并非完全 out-of-distribution。在 α=0.50 下， canary\n456\t    ranking 应保持因为 ECE 和 token_entropy 检测的是分布偏移的通用信号（calibration degradation 和 entropy\n457\t    collapse），不依赖特定数据集的词汇分布。 Lead time 可能缩短到 1 gen（WikiText 在 α=0.50 也是 1 gen），因为\n458\t    C4 的 higher initial diversity 意味着 diversity 指标的下降需要更大的分布偏移才开始——但同时 canary 也需要更大偏移才触发\n459\t    2σ，两个效应部分抵消。 Effect size 略低 (0.88 vs 0.90) 因为 C4 的 heterogeneity 增加噪声。 Collapse\n460\t    略快因为 C4 子集的 domain 多样性使得 mode collapse 更容易发生（模型 倾向 collapse 到高频 domain patterns）。\n461\t\n462\t    '\n463\t  tables:\n464\t  - name: 'Table 5: C4 vs WikiText-103 comparison (α=0.50)'\n465\t    columns:\n466\t    - metric\n467\t    - WikiText_gen10\n468\t    - C4_gen10\n469\t    - delta_pct\n470\t    rows:\n471\t    - - perplexity\n472\t      - 185.3\n473\t      - 210.5\n474\t      - +13.6%\n475\t    - - distinct_1\n476\t      - 0.108\n477\t      - 0.098\n478\t      - -9.3%\n479\t    - - ECE\n480\t      - 0.167\n481\t      - 0.178\n482\t      - +6.6%\n483\t    - - token_entropy\n484\t      - 2.18\n485\t      - 2.09\n486\t      - -4.1%\n487\t    - - ECE→distinct_1 lead (gen)\n488\t      - 1\n489\t      - 1\n490\t      - '0'\n491\t    - - ECE→distinct_1 TY p\n492\t      - 0.008\n493\t      - 0.012\n494\t      - —\n495\t    - - ECE→distinct_1 effect_r\n496\t      - 0.9\n497\t      - 0.88\n498\t      - '-0.02'\n499\t  figures_description:\n500\t  - 'Fig 5: Side-by-side trajectory comparison WikiText vs C4 at α=0.50. Same axes,\n501\t    same metrics. 视觉上确认 ranking 和 lead 保持.'\n502\t  analysis: 'C4 验证了 canary ranking 的 domain-independence：ECE 和 token_entropy 仍是最佳\n503\t    canary。 Lead time 在 α=0.50 下保持 1 gen（未缩短也未延长），effect size 略降但仍 >0.85。 这足以支撑 \"canary\n504\t    ranking transfers across domains\" 的 claim，但需诚实报告 effect size 的下降。不宜 over-claim\n505\t    \"universal canary\"。\n506\t\n507\t    '\n508\t- name: Pythia-1.4B scale spot-check\n509\t  plan_id: plan_005\n510\t  description: 'Pythia-1.4B × WikiText-103 × α=0.50 × 3 seeds × 10 gen. 验证 canary\n511\t    lead 是否跨规模保持。\n512\t\n513\t    '\n514\t  expected_results:\n515\t    canary_ranking_preserved: true\n516\t    ECE_to_distinct1_lead_gen: 1.0\n517\t    ECE_to_distinct1_TY_pval_median: 0.029\n518\t    seeds_significant_ECE_distinct1: 2/3\n519\t    token_entropy_to_distinct1_lead_gen: 1.0\n520\t    token_entropy_to_distinct1_TY_pval_median: 0.038\n521\t    seeds_significant_token_entropy_distinct1: 2/3\n522\t    ECE_to_perplexity_lead_gen: 0.0\n523\t    gen10_perplexity_1_4B: 142.8\n524\t    gen10_distinct_1_1_4B: 0.121\n525\t    gen10_ECE_1_4B: 0.131\n526\t    cross_seed_variance_vs_410M: higher\n527\t    effect_size_r_ECE_distinct1: 0.85\n528\t    collapse_speed_vs_410M: slower\n529\t  result_rationale: '1.4B 参数量是 410M 的 ~3.4 倍。更大模型在 iterative SC 下 collapse 更慢（更大的\n530\t    representation capacity 和更好的 initial calibration 提供 buffer）。这意味着： (1) 各指标的绝对变化幅度更小（gen10\n531\t    perplexity 142 vs 185），信噪比降低； (2) canary lead 保持（1 gen）因为 lead 源于指标类型的本质差异（分布指标\n532\t    vs 多样性 指标的响应速度），与模型规模无关； (3) cross-seed variance 更高因为 1.4B 训练的随机性更大（更大参数空间 + 相同数据量\n533\t    = 更多局部最优的变异），导致仅 2/3 seeds 达到显著。 Effect size 下降到 0.85 因为 slower collapse = 更平缓的趋势\n534\t    = 更弱的统计信号。 结果 \"noisy but directionally consistent\" —— 符合 median 档预期。\n535\t\n536\t    '\n537\t  tables:\n538\t  - name: 'Table 6: Scale comparison 410M vs 1.4B (α=0.50, WikiText)'\n539\t    columns:\n540\t    - metric\n541\t    - 410M_gen10\n542\t    - 1.4B_gen10\n543\t    - delta_pct\n544\t    rows:\n545\t    - - perplexity\n546\t      - 185.3\n547\t      - 142.8\n548\t      - -22.9%\n549\t    - - distinct_1\n550\t      - 0.108\n551\t      - 0.121\n552\t      - +12.0%\n553\t    - - ECE\n554\t      - 0.167\n555\t      - 0.131\n556\t      - -21.6%\n557\t    - - token_entropy\n558\t      - 2.18\n559\t      - 2.41\n560\t      - +10.6%\n561\t    - - ECE→distinct_1 lead\n562\t      - 1\n563\t      - 1\n564\t      - '0'\n565\t    - - ECE→distinct_1 TY p\n566\t      - 0.008\n567\t      - 0.029\n568\t      - '+0.021'\n569\t    - - ECE→distinct_1 effect_r\n570\t      - 0.9\n571\t      - 0.85\n572\t      - '-0.05'\n573\t    - - ECE→distinct_1 seeds_sig\n574\t      - 3/3\n575\t      - 2/3\n576\t      - '-1'\n577\t  figures_description:\n578\t  - 'Fig 6: 410M vs 1.4B trajectory overlay at α=0.50. Dual y-axis for perplexity\n579\t    (left) and distinct_1 (right). Shaded ±1σ bands. 1.4B bands visibly wider.'\n580\t  analysis: 'Scaling trend: canary ranking and lead direction preserved, but statistical\n581\t    power drops. 这是 expected tradeoff——更大模型 collapse 更慢 = 信号更弱 = 需要更多 gen 或更多 seeds。\n582\t    Paper 应报告为 \"directionally consistent scaling trend\" 并标注 limitation： 完整 scale validation\n583\t    需要更长训练和更多 seeds（留作 future work）。 不宜用 1.4B 结果 over-claim scaling law。\n584\t\n585\t    '\n586\t- name: Extended run 20 gen (max_lag truncation check)\n587\t  plan_id: plan_006\n588\t  description: 'Pythia-410M × WikiText-103 × α=1.0 × 20 gen × 2 seeds. 增大 max_lag\n589\t    到 10，检验 token_entropy→perplexity 的 lag=-5 是否为截断伪影。\n590\t\n591\t    '\n592\t  expected_results:\n593\t    token_entropy_to_perplexity_lead_maxlag5: 0\n594\t    token_entropy_to_perplexity_lead_maxlag10: 0\n595\t    ECE_to_distinct1_lead_maxlag10: 2\n596\t    token_entropy_to_distinct1_lead_maxlag10: 2\n597\t    gen20_perplexity: 4280.5\n598\t    gen20_distinct_1: 0.018\n599\t    gen20_token_entropy: 0.72\n600\t    gen20_ECE: 0.623\n601\t    collapse_saturation_gen: 14\n602\t    post_saturation_behavior: all metrics plateau at floor/ceiling after gen ~14\n603\t    seeds_consistent: 2/2\n604\t  result_rationale: '20 gen 在 α=1.0 下提供足够长的序列来排除 max_lag truncation。如果 token_entropy\n605\t    真的 lead perplexity，更长序列 + 更大 max_lag 应该能检测到。预计仍然 lead=0： 在 100% SC 下，perplexity\n606\t    和 canary 的恶化由同一个机制驱动（distribution collapse → simultaneous calibration loss + fluency\n607\t    loss），没有 temporal separation。 这不是检测力不足，而是 genuine 同步性。 新发现：gen ~14 后所有指标 saturate（distinct_1\n608\t    接近 0，entropy 接近 ln(1)=0， perplexity 增长放缓因为模型已完全 degenerate）。20 gen 提供了完整的 collapse\n609\t    trajectory 包括 saturation phase，对 paper 的 Fig 1 有展示价值。 canary→diversity lead 增大到\n610\t    2 gen (max_lag=10)，与 plan_003 的 max_lag=7 一致， 确认更大 max_lag 能检测到更长 lead。\n611\t\n612\t    '\n613\t  tables:\n614\t  - name: 'Table S2: Extended run lead-lag (max_lag=10)'\n615\t    columns:\n616\t    - canary\n617\t    - target\n618\t    - lead_lag5\n619\t    - lead_lag7\n620\t    - lead_lag10\n621\t    - conclusion\n622\t    rows:\n623\t    - - ECE\n624\t      - distinct_1\n625\t      - 1\n626\t      - 1\n627\t      - 2\n628\t      - mild truncation at lag≤7\n629\t    - - token_entropy\n630\t      - distinct_1\n631\t      - 1\n632\t      - 2\n633\t      - 2\n634\t      - truncation confirmed at lag=5\n635\t    - - ECE\n636\t      - perplexity\n637\t      - 0\n638\t      - 0\n639\t      - 0\n640\t      - genuine synchrony, not truncation\n641\t    - - token_entropy\n642\t      - perplexity\n643\t      - 0\n644\t      - 0\n645\t      - 0\n646\t      - genuine synchrony, not truncation\n647\t  figures_description:\n648\t  - 'Fig S4: 20-gen trajectory (α=1.0). Full collapse curve including saturation phase.\n649\t    Vertical line at gen ~14 marking saturation onset.'\n650\t  - 'Fig S5: TY lead estimate as function of max_lag (3–10). Shows canary→diversity\n651\t    lead stabilizing at 2 for max_lag≥7, canary→perplexity flat at 0.'\n652\t  analysis: 'Extended run 解决了 two questions: (1) max_lag truncation 对 canary→diversity\n653\t    有 mild 影响 (lead=1→2)，对 canary→perplexity 无影响 (stays 0); (2) 100% SC 的 complete\n654\t    collapse trajectory 包括 saturation at gen ~14。 建议主文报告 max_lag=7 或 10 的结果（避免已知截断的\n655\t    max_lag=5），附录给出 sensitivity。\n656\t\n657\t    '\n658\t- name: CRS intervention experiment\n659\t  plan_id: plan_007\n660\t  description: 'CRS-predictive intervention vs no-intervention baseline. Pythia-410M\n661\t    × WikiText-103 × α=0.75 × 3 seeds × 10 gen. CRS 在 ECE 超过 threshold 时 trigger re-weighting\n662\t    to increase real data ratio.\n663\t\n664\t    '\n665\t  expected_results:\n666\t    baseline_gen10_distinct_1: 0.083\n667\t    baseline_gen10_perplexity: 512.7\n668\t    baseline_gen10_ECE: 0.312\n669\t    intervention_gen10_distinct_1: 0.118\n670\t    intervention_gen10_perplexity: 324.6\n671\t    intervention_gen10_ECE: 0.195\n672\t    diversity_preserved_pct: 42.2\n673\t    perplexity_reduction_pct: 36.7\n674\t    intervention_trigger_gen_median: 3.0\n675\t    intervention_trigger_gen_range:\n676\t    - 2\n677\t    - 4\n678\t    false_trigger_rate: 0.0\n679\t    seeds_with_improvement: 3/3\n680\t  result_rationale: 'α=0.75 是一个有意义的测试点：collapse 足够严重以展示 intervention 效果，但不至于 像 α=1.0\n681\t    那样 catastrophic（无法挽救）。CRS 基于 ECE threshold 触发（ECE 在 gen 2-4 超过 2σ baseline）。触发后，CRS\n682\t    将有效 α 从 0.75 降到 ~0.50（增加真实 数据比例），从而减缓后续 collapse。 预计 diversity 保留 ~42%（不是完全挽救，因为\n683\t    (1) 触发前已有 2-3 gen 的损伤， (2) CRS 只调整比例不改变训练动态）。Perplexity 改善更大 (~37%) 因为 perplexity\n684\t    对数据质量比例的响应更直接。 所有 3 seeds 都有改善因为 ECE threshold 的 trigger 是 reliable 的（plan_001\n685\t    确认 ECE 在 α=0.75 下 3/3 seeds 显著 lead diversity）。 这个实验的价值不在于 CRS 本身的 novelty，而是证明\n686\t    \"predictive monitoring enables actionable intervention\"——将 canary lead 从学术发现转化为实用工具。\n687\t\n688\t    '\n689\t  tables:\n690\t  - name: 'Table 7: Intervention comparison at α=0.75'\n691\t    columns:\n692\t    - condition\n693\t    - gen10_distinct_1\n694\t    - gen10_ppl\n695\t    - gen10_ECE\n696\t    - diversity_preserved\n697\t    rows:\n698\t    - - no-intervention\n699\t      - 0.083\n700\t      - 512.7\n701\t      - 0.312\n702\t      - —\n703\t    - - CRS-predictive\n704\t      - 0.118\n705\t      - 324.6\n706\t      - 0.195\n707\t      - 42.2%\n708\t    - - oracle (α=0.50 from start)\n709\t      - 0.108\n710\t      - 185.3\n711\t      - 0.167\n712\t      - benchmark\n713\t  figures_description:\n714\t  - 'Fig 7: Intervention timeline. X-axis: gen. Two trajectory bundles (no-intervention\n715\t    red, CRS blue). Vertical line at trigger gen. Shows divergence after intervention.'\n716\t  - 'Fig S6: Per-seed trigger gen distribution and post-trigger trajectory variance.'\n717\t  analysis: 'Intervention 实验将 canary lead 的学术发现转化为 actionable tool。42% diversity preservation\n718\t    不是 dramatic 但 non-trivial。关键 insight：CRS 的效果上限受限于 trigger latency（ECE 需要 2-3 gen\n719\t    才触发）和干预力度（仅调整混合比例）。 Paper 应将此定位为 \"proof of concept for predictive monitoring\"\n720\t    而非 \"complete solution to model collapse\"。与 DCES (reactive) 的对比：CRS 在 trigger gen\n721\t    就 干预，DCES 需要等到 diversity 本身下降才反应（多 1-2 gen 延迟）。\n722\t\n723\t    '\n724\t- name: Accumulate vs Replace 数据策略 ablation\n725\t  plan_id: plan_008\n726\t  description: 'α=0.50 下 accumulate (保留所有历史生成数据) vs replace (每代只用最新生成数据) × Pythia-410M\n727\t    × WikiText-103 × 3 seeds × 10 gen. 验证 Fu et al. 理论（accumulate 保证收敛）并测 canary 行为差异。\n728\t\n729\t    '\n730\t  expected_results:\n731\t    replace_gen10_distinct_1: 0.108\n732\t    replace_gen10_perplexity: 185.3\n733\t    replace_ECE_to_distinct1_lead: 1\n734\t    accumulate_gen10_distinct_1: 0.135\n735\t    accumulate_gen10_perplexity: 112.4\n736\t    accumulate_ECE_to_distinct1_lead: 1\n737\t    accumulate_collapse_speed: ~40% slower\n738\t    accumulate_canary_ranking_preserved: true\n739\t    accumulate_canary_lead_preserved: true\n740\t    accumulate_effect_size_vs_replace: lower (0.82 vs 0.90)\n741\t  result_rationale: 'Accumulate 模式通过保留所有历史数据稀释了 synthetic contamination 的有效比例—— 到\n742\t    gen 10，累积数据中真实数据仍占相当比例（不像 replace 模式每代都是 α=0.50 fresh synthetic）。Fu et al. 的理论预测\n743\t    accumulate 最终收敛到 fixed point 而非 diverge，empirically 表现为 collapse 速度减慢 ~40%。 Canary\n744\t    ranking 和 lead 保持（1 gen）因为 lead 的机制（指标类型的响应速度差异） 不依赖 data strategy。但 effect size\n745\t    降低因为 slower collapse = 更平缓的趋势 = 更弱的 temporal precedence signal。 这个实验的主要价值是 (1)\n746\t    验证 Fu et al. 理论预测, (2) 证明 canary 行为对 data strategy robust, (3) 为 practitioner\n747\t    提供 actionable recommendation（accumulate 优于 replace）。\n748\t\n749\t    '\n750\t  tables:\n751\t  - name: 'Table 8: Accumulate vs Replace (α=0.50)'\n752\t    columns:\n753\t    - strategy\n754\t    - gen10_distinct_1\n755\t    - gen10_ppl\n756\t    - collapse_rate\n757\t    - ECE→d1_lead\n758\t    - effect_r\n759\t    rows:\n760\t    - - replace\n761\t      - 0.108\n762\t      - 185.3\n763\t      - 1.0x (baseline)\n764\t      - 1\n765\t      - 0.9\n766\t    - - accumulate\n767\t      - 0.135\n768\t      - 112.4\n769\t      - 0.6x\n770\t      - 1\n771\t      - 0.82\n772\t  figures_description:\n773\t  - 'Fig S7: Accumulate vs Replace trajectories. 4 metrics × 2 strategies. Accumulate\n774\t    curves visibly flatter.'\n775\t  analysis: Accumulate 减缓 collapse 但不消除——符合 Fu et al. 的收敛到 degraded fixed point 的预测。Canary\n776\t    lead 保持是 positive result，说明监控策略对 data pipeline 选择 robust。 Effect size 降低是 expected\n777\t    tradeoff。Paper 中定位为 supplementary ablation， 不作为主要贡献。\n778\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8b658381-150c-4d7a-982d-1cebf7ec2b62","uuid":"88bd8e8c-b172-4de4-b8a4-0e1fa620df49","timestamp":"2026-05-14T19:20:36.796Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_4/projects/distrib_canary_collapse/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260514T184925/median/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: 'Claim 1 fully supported: canary→diversity lead 1-2 gen, robust\n  across seeds. Claim 2 softened to regime-dependent gradient: canary→perplexity lead\n  only at α=0.25, marginal, phase boundary is a gradual degradation zone around α∈[0.25,0.5]\n  rather than a sharp transition. Claim 3 softened: TY overturns 15-29% naive associations\n  — useful methodological contribution but not dramatic. Intervention (plan_007) needed\n  to strengthen practical narrative. Target AAAI with honest framing; prepare EMNLP\n  Findings fallback.\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: α-sweep predictability phase diagram\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: 'Pythia-410M × WikiText-103 × α∈{0.25, 0.50, 0.75} × 10 gen × 3 seeds.\n    Run Toda-Yamamoto panel temporal precedence for all canary→target pairs at each\n    α.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    alpha_025_canary_diversity_lead_gen: 2.0\n    alpha_025_canary_diversity_TY_pval_median: 0.003\n    alpha_025_canary_diversity_seeds_significant: 3/3\n    alpha_025_canary_perplexity_lead_gen: 1.0\n    alpha_025_canary_perplexity_TY_pval_median: 0.042\n    alpha_025_canary_perplexity_seeds_significant: 2/3\n    alpha_025_gen10_perplexity: 78.5\n    alpha_025_gen10_distinct_1: 0.142\n    alpha_025_gen10_token_entropy: 2.61\n    alpha_025_gen10_ece: 0.089\n    alpha_050_canary_diversity_lead_gen: 1.0\n    alpha_050_canary_diversity_TY_pval_median: 0.008\n    alpha_050_canary_diversity_seeds_significant: 3/3\n    alpha_050_canary_perplexity_lead_gen: 0.0\n    alpha_050_canary_perplexity_TY_pval_median: 0.31\n    alpha_050_canary_perplexity_seeds_significant: 0/3\n    alpha_050_gen10_perplexity: 185.3\n    alpha_050_gen10_distinct_1: 0.108\n    alpha_050_gen10_token_entropy: 2.18\n    alpha_050_gen10_ece: 0.167\n    alpha_075_canary_diversity_lead_gen: 1.0\n    alpha_075_canary_diversity_TY_pval_median: 0.017\n    alpha_075_canary_diversity_seeds_significant: 3/3\n    alpha_075_canary_perplexity_lead_gen: 0.0\n    alpha_075_canary_perplexity_TY_pval_median: 0.58\n    alpha_075_canary_perplexity_seeds_significant: 0/3\n    alpha_075_gen10_perplexity: 512.7\n    alpha_075_gen10_distinct_1: 0.083\n    alpha_075_gen10_token_entropy: 1.68\n    alpha_075_gen10_ece: 0.312\n    effective_rank_lead_any_alpha: not significant\n    self_bleu_lead_any_alpha: not significant\n  result_rationale: 'α=0.25 保留 75% 真实数据，collapse 进程最慢。diversity 退化需要更多代数积累才显现， 给 canary（ECE/entropy\n    对分布偏移更敏感）提供 2 gen 的领先窗口。perplexity 在此 regime 下也是渐进恶化而非突变，canary 有机会以 ~1 gen 领先，但效应弱——因为\n    75% 真实数据的 锚定效应使 perplexity 变化幅度小，信噪比低，仅 2/3 seeds 达到显著。 α=0.50 是过渡区：collapse 加速，canary→diversity\n    仍有 1 gen lead（diversity 指标的 累积性质使其滞后于 distributional shift），但 perplexity 开始与 canary\n    近同步恶化， TY 无法分离 temporal precedence。 α=0.75 接近 full SC：collapse 动力学加速到 canary 和\n    diversity 几乎同代恶化，仅因 diversity 的定义性滞后保留 1 gen lead；perplexity 与 canary 完全同步崩溃。\n    effective_rank 和 self_bleu 在所有 α 下均无显著 lead——与 MVP 一致，这两个指标要么 噪声太大（self_bleu 的\n    sampling variance），要么对 synthetic data drift 不够敏感 （effective_rank 在 embedding space\n    退化前不变化）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 2: Toda-Yamamoto lead-lag results across α'\n    columns:\n    - α\n    - canary_family\n    - target\n    - TY_lead_gen\n    - TY_p_median\n    - seeds_sig\n    - effect_size_r\n    rows:\n    - - 0.25\n      - ECE\n      - distinct_1\n      - 2\n      - 0.002\n      - 3/3\n      - 0.93\n    - - 0.25\n      - token_entropy\n      - distinct_1\n      - 2\n      - 0.004\n      - 3/3\n      - 0.91\n    - - 0.25\n      - ECE\n      - perplexity\n      - 1\n      - 0.038\n      - 2/3\n      - 0.72\n    - - 0.25\n      - token_entropy\n      - perplexity\n      - 1\n      - 0.047\n      - 2/3\n      - 0.68\n    - - 0.5\n      - ECE\n      - distinct_1\n      - 1\n      - 0.006\n      - 3/3\n      - 0.9\n    - - 0.5\n      - token_entropy\n      - distinct_1\n      - 1\n      - 0.01\n      - 3/3\n      - 0.88\n    - - 0.5\n      - ECE\n      - perplexity\n      - 0\n      - 0.28\n      - 0/3\n      - 0.31\n    - - 0.5\n      - token_entropy\n      - perplexity\n      - 0\n      - 0.35\n      - 0/3\n      - 0.25\n    - - 0.75\n      - ECE\n      - distinct_1\n      - 1\n      - 0.014\n      - 3/3\n      - 0.89\n    - - 0.75\n      - token_entropy\n      - distinct_1\n      - 1\n      - 0.019\n      - 3/3\n      - 0.88\n    - - 0.75\n      - ECE\n      - perplexity\n      - 0\n      - 0.52\n      - 0/3\n      - 0.14\n    - - 0.75\n      - token_entropy\n      - perplexity\n      - 0\n      - 0.63\n      - 0/3\n      - 0.09\n  - name: 'Table S1: Failed canary families across α'\n    columns:\n    - α\n    - canary_family\n    - target\n    - TY_p_median\n    - failure_reason\n    rows:\n    - - 0.25\n      - effective_rank\n      - distinct_1\n      - 0.41\n      - rank plateau until gen 6-7\n    - - 0.25\n      - self_bleu\n      - distinct_1\n      - 0.55\n      - high sampling variance\n    - - 0.5\n      - effective_rank\n      - distinct_1\n      - 0.38\n      - rank plateau until gen 5\n    - - 0.5\n      - self_bleu\n      - distinct_1\n      - 0.62\n      - high sampling variance\n    - - 0.75\n      - effective_rank\n      - distinct_1\n      - 0.29\n      - noisy but borderline\n    - - 0.75\n      - self_bleu\n      - distinct_1\n      - 0.48\n      - sampling variance + floor effect\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 2: Predictability phase diagram. X-axis: α (0.25–1.0). Y-axis: TY-estimated\n    lead (gen). 两条曲线: canary→diversity (从 2 gen 单调降至 ~1 gen) 和 canary→perplexity (从\n    ~1 gen 降至 0). 灰色 shading 标注 ''predictable zone'' (α<0.5) vs ''synchronous collapse\n    zone'' (α>0.5). Boundary 是渐变带而非 sharp line.'\n  - 'Fig 3: Per-α metric trajectories. 3×2 panel (3 α × 2 targets). 每个 panel 叠加 ECE\n    (red), token_entropy (blue), distinct_1 (black dashed). 可视化 lead 如何随 α 收缩.'\n  - 'Fig S1: Per-seed scatter for α=0.25 canary→perplexity, showing 2/3 seeds significant,\n    1 seed nonsignificant (p=0.11).'\n  analysis: 'Phase diagram 的核心发现：canary→diversity lead 是 monotonically decreasing\n    function of α, 从 α=0.25 的 2 gen 到 α=0.75/1.0 的 ~1 gen。这意味着 early warning window\n    随 contamination ratio 缩短但不消失——即使在 α=0.75 仍有 1 gen lead for diversity。 canary→perplexity\n    的 boundary 在 α≈0.25-0.50 之间：仅在 α=0.25 可检测到 marginal lead， 且 cross-seed consistency\n    仅 2/3。这定义了 phase diagram 的 \"partially predictable\" 区域。 narrative: \"we map the\n    boundary of predictability\" 而非 \"we show canaries predict collapse\"。\n\n    '\n- name: '方法论 ablation: naive correlation vs Toda-Yamamoto'\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '在 MVP 4-seed (α=1.0) + plan_001 α-sweep 数据上，对比四种方法: (i) naive Pearson\n    lag-correlation, (ii) 差分后 cross-correlation, (iii) threshold-based lead time (2σ\n    onset), (iv) Toda-Yamamoto panel temporal precedence. 量化各方法的 Type I error rate\n    和伪显著比例。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    total_pairwise_associations_tested: 96\n    naive_pearson_significant_count: 71\n    differenced_xcorr_significant_count: 52\n    threshold_2sigma_significant_count: 58\n    TY_significant_count: 54\n    naive_overturned_by_TY_count: 19\n    naive_overturned_by_TY_pct: 20.0\n    naive_only_significant_examples: effective_rank→distinct_1 (α=0.75), self_bleu→perplexity\n      (α=0.50), ECE→perplexity (α=0.50)\n    TY_and_differenced_agree_pct: 85.0\n    threshold_vs_TY_concordance_pct: 78.0\n  result_rationale: 'Naive Pearson correlation 在非平稳时间序列上 inflate Type I error，因为两个共同趋势\n    的序列（如都单调恶化的指标）即使无因果关系也会产生高相关。在 α=1.0 (MVP) 数据中， 所有指标都单调恶化，naive 方法会将几乎所有 pair\n    标记为显著。在 α=0.50/0.75 中， 部分指标（如 effective_rank）前期平台后期骤降，与 diversity 的单调下降产生虚假的 lag\n    correlation。 TY 通过在 VAR 中加入额外 lag 吸收非平稳性，只检测 Granger-causal temporal precedence。\n    预计 ~20% 的 naive 显著关联被推翻——主要是 (1) failed canary families (effective_rank, self_bleu)\n    的虚假显著, (2) canary→perplexity 在 α≥0.50 的虚假显著。 20% 而非更高，因为 canary→diversity 的 lead\n    是 genuine 的（即使 naive 也能捕捉）， 所以大部分真阳性在两种方法下一致。差分法与 TY 85% 一致因为差分也处理了一阶非平稳， 但 TY\n    对高阶整合更 robust。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: Method comparison — significance rates'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - Significant_pairs\n    - Total_pairs\n    - Rate\n    - Overturned_by_TY\n    rows:\n    - - Naive Pearson\n      - 71\n      - 96\n      - 74.0%\n      - 19 (20%)\n    - - Differenced XCorr\n      - 52\n      - 96\n      - 54.2%\n      - 3 (3%)\n    - - Threshold (2σ)\n      - 58\n      - 96\n      - 60.4%\n      - 8 (8%)\n    - - Toda-Yamamoto\n      - 54\n      - 96\n      - 56.3%\n      - —\n  - name: 'Table 4: Overturned associations breakdown'\n    columns:\n    - canary_family\n    - target\n    - α\n    - naive_p\n    - TY_p\n    - diagnosis\n    rows:\n    - - effective_rank\n      - distinct_1\n      - 0.75\n      - 0.008\n      - 0.29\n      - 'spurious: co-trending'\n    - - effective_rank\n      - distinct_2\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.012\n      - 0.38\n      - 'spurious: co-trending'\n    - - self_bleu\n      - perplexity\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.015\n      - 0.55\n      - 'spurious: shared nonstationary trend'\n    - - self_bleu\n      - distinct_1\n      - 0.75\n      - 0.021\n      - 0.48\n      - 'spurious: variance-driven'\n    - - ECE\n      - perplexity\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.031\n      - 0.28\n      - 'spurious: co-trending without lead'\n    - - token_entropy\n      - perplexity\n      - 0.5\n      - 0.034\n      - 0.35\n      - 'spurious: co-trending without lead'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 4: Bar chart. 每个 method 的 significant pair 数量，colored by genuine (TY-confirmed)\n    vs overturned. 直观展示 naive inflation.'\n  - 'Fig S2: Heatmap. 4 methods × 24 canary-target-α combinations. Cell color = p-value.\n    突出 naive 与 TY 不一致的 cells.'\n  analysis: '20% overturned rate 证明 naive correlation 在非平稳训练指标上不可靠，但不是灾难性的。 方法论贡献的叙事：TY\n    提供 \"more conservative but reliable\" 估计，特别在 failed canary families 上避免了误导性结论。如果直接用\n    naive correlation 写论文，会错误声称 effective_rank 和 self_bleu 也是 viable canaries。这足以作为\n    methodological contribution 但不应过分渲染。\n\n    '\n- name: MVP 结果 formalization (max_lag=7)\n  plan_id: plan_003\n  description: '在 MVP 4-seed 100% SC 数据上，max_lag 从 5 增大到 7，重跑 TY 检验。 确认 ECE/token_entropy→diversity\n    的 lead time 精确值。 用 2σ signal onset 定义交叉验证。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    ECE_to_distinct1_lead_maxlag5: 1\n    ECE_to_distinct1_lead_maxlag7: 1\n    token_entropy_to_distinct1_lead_maxlag5: 1\n    token_entropy_to_distinct1_lead_maxlag7: 2\n    ECE_to_distinct2_lead_maxlag7: 1\n    token_entropy_to_distinct2_lead_maxlag7: 1\n    ECE_to_perplexity_lead_maxlag7: 0\n    truncation_artifact_detected: partial — token_entropy→distinct_1 增加 1 gen at maxlag=7\n    cross_seed_consistency_maxlag7: 4/4 for ECE→distinct_1; 3/4 for token_entropy→distinct_1\n      at lag=2\n    effect_size_r_ECE_distinct1: 0.94\n    effect_size_r_token_entropy_distinct1: 0.91\n    signal_onset_2sigma_ECE_gen: 2.0\n    signal_onset_2sigma_distinct1_gen: 3.5\n    signal_onset_2sigma_perplexity_gen: 2.0\n  result_rationale: '在 α=1.0 (100% SC) 下，collapse 进程快速：10 gen 的 time series 很短，max_lag=5\n    消耗大量自由度。增大到 max_lag=7 后，token_entropy→distinct_1 的 lead 从 1 增到 2 gen ——说明 max_lag=5\n    确实存在 mild truncation。但 ECE→distinct_1 不变（lag=1），因为 ECE 的响应更即时（calibration error\n    在 distribution shift 第一代就跳变）。 canary→perplexity 在 max_lag=7 下仍无显著 lead (lag=0)，确认\n    100% SC 下 perplexity 与 canary 同步崩溃不是截断伪影而是 genuine 同步性。 2σ onset 分析显示 ECE 在 gen\n    2 就超出 baseline 2σ，distinct_1 在 gen 3-4 才 显著偏离——视觉上也能看出 ~1.5 gen lead，与 TY 的 1-2\n    gen 一致。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: MVP lead-lag summary (max_lag=7)'\n    columns:\n    - canary\n    - target\n    - TY_lead_gen\n    - p_value_median\n    - seeds_sig\n    - effect_r\n    - truncation_vs_lag5\n    rows:\n    - - ECE\n      - distinct_1\n      - 1\n      - 0.001\n      - 4/4\n      - 0.94\n      - unchanged\n    - - ECE\n      - distinct_2\n      - 1\n      - 0.002\n      - 4/4\n      - 0.92\n      - unchanged\n    - - token_entropy\n      - distinct_1\n      - 2\n      - 0.003\n      - 3/4\n      - 0.91\n      - +1 gen (was 1)\n    - - token_entropy\n      - distinct_2\n      - 1\n      - 0.004\n      - 4/4\n      - 0.9\n      - unchanged\n    - - ECE\n      - perplexity\n      - 0\n      - 0.48\n      - 0/4\n      - 0.12\n      - unchanged\n    - - token_entropy\n      - perplexity\n      - 0\n      - 0.55\n      - 0/4\n      - 0.08\n      - unchanged\n    - - effective_rank\n      - distinct_1\n      - —\n      - 0.37\n      - 0/4\n      - —\n      - —\n    - - self_bleu\n      - distinct_1\n      - —\n      - 0.61\n      - 0/4\n      - —\n      - —\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1: 4-seed overlay of ECE, token_entropy, distinct_1, distinct_2, perplexity\n    over 10 gen (α=1.0). Error bands = ±1σ across seeds. Vertical dashed lines mark\n    2σ onset for each metric. Visual lead ~1-2 gen for canary→diversity.'\n  - 'Fig S3: max_lag sensitivity plot. X-axis: max_lag (3–7). Y-axis: TY-estimated\n    lead. 每条线一个 canary-target pair. 展示 token_entropy→distinct_1 在 lag=5→7 时 lead 增加.'\n  analysis: 'Truncation 效应存在但 mild：仅影响 token_entropy→distinct_1 一个 pair (+1 gen)。\n    核心结论不变：ECE 和 token_entropy lead diversity 1-2 gen，不 lead perplexity。 建议主文报告 max_lag=7\n    结果，附录给出 sensitivity analysis。\n\n    '\n- name: C4 cross-domain validation\n  plan_id: plan_004\n  description: 'Pythia-410M × C4 × α=0.50 × 3 seeds × 10 gen. 验证 canary ranking (ECE\n    > token_entropy > failed families) 是否跨域保持, 以及 lead time 是否缩短。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    canary_ranking_preserved: true\n    ECE_to_distinct1_lead_gen: 1.0\n    token_entropy_to_distinct1_lead_gen: 1.0\n    ECE_to_distinct1_TY_pval_median: 0.012\n    seeds_significant_ECE_distinct1: 3/3\n    ECE_to_perplexity_lead_gen: 0.0\n    gen10_perplexity_C4: 210.5\n    gen10_distinct_1_C4: 0.098\n    collapse_speed_vs_wiki: slightly faster\n    lead_time_vs_wiki_alpha050: same (1 gen) or shorter\n    effect_size_r_ECE_distinct1: 0.88\n  result_rationale: 'C4 比 WikiText-103 更多样（web crawl vs curated Wikipedia），但 Pythia\n    在 the Pile 上预训练（包含部分 web text），所以 C4 并非完全 out-of-distribution。在 α=0.50 下， canary\n    ranking 应保持因为 ECE 和 token_entropy 检测的是分布偏移的通用信号（calibration degradation 和 entropy\n    collapse），不依赖特定数据集的词汇分布。 Lead time 可能缩短到 1 gen（WikiText 在 α=0.50 也是 1 gen），因为\n    C4 的 higher initial diversity 意味着 diversity 指标的下降需要更大的分布偏移才开始——但同时 canary 也需要更大偏移才触发\n    2σ，两个效应部分抵消。 Effect size 略低 (0.88 vs 0.90) 因为 C4 的 heterogeneity 增加噪声。 Collapse\n    略快因为 C4 子集的 domain 多样性使得 mode collapse 更容易发生（模型 倾向 collapse 到高频 domain patterns）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: C4 vs WikiText-103 comparison (α=0.50)'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - WikiText_gen10\n    - C4_gen10\n    - delta_pct\n    rows:\n    - - perplexity\n      - 185.3\n      - 210.5\n      - +13.6%\n    - - distinct_1\n      - 0.108\n      - 0.098\n      - -9.3%\n    - - ECE\n      - 0.167\n      - 0.178\n      - +6.6%\n    - - token_entropy\n      - 2.18\n      - 2.09\n      - -4.1%\n    - - ECE→distinct_1 lead (gen)\n      - 1\n      - 1\n      - '0'\n    - - ECE→distinct_1 TY p\n      - 0.008\n      - 0.012\n      - —\n    - - ECE→distinct_1 effect_r\n      - 0.9\n      - 0.88\n      - '-0.02'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 5: Side-by-side trajectory comparison WikiText vs C4 at α=0.50. Same axes,\n    same metrics. 视觉上确认 ranking 和 lead 保持.'\n  analysis: 'C4 验证了 canary ranking 的 domain-independence：ECE 和 token_entropy 仍是最佳\n    canary。 Lead time 在 α=0.50 下保持 1 gen（未缩短也未延长），effect size 略降但仍 >0.85。 这足以支撑 \"canary\n    ranking transfers across domains\" 的 claim，但需诚实报告 effect size 的下降。不宜 over-claim\n    \"universal canary\"。\n\n    '\n- name: Pythia-1.4B scale spot-check\n  plan_id: plan_005\n  description: 'Pythia-1.4B × WikiText-103 × α=0.50 × 3 seeds × 10 gen. 验证 canary\n    lead 是否跨规模保持。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    canary_ranking_preserved: true\n    ECE_to_distinct1_lead_gen: 1.0\n    ECE_to_distinct1_TY_pval_median: 0.029\n    seeds_significant_ECE_distinct1: 2/3\n    token_entropy_to_distinct1_lead_gen: 1.0\n    token_entropy_to_distinct1_TY_pval_median: 0.038\n    seeds_significant_token_entropy_distinct1: 2/3\n    ECE_to_perplexity_lead_gen: 0.0\n    gen10_perplexity_1_4B: 142.8\n    gen10_distinct_1_1_4B: 0.121\n    gen10_ECE_1_4B: 0.131\n    cross_seed_variance_vs_410M: higher\n    effect_size_r_ECE_distinct1: 0.85\n    collapse_speed_vs_410M: slower\n  result_rationale: '1.4B 参数量是 410M 的 ~3.4 倍。更大模型在 iterative SC 下 collapse 更慢（更大的\n    representation capacity 和更好的 initial calibration 提供 buffer）。这意味着： (1) 各指标的绝对变化幅度更小（gen10\n    perplexity 142 vs 185），信噪比降低； (2) canary lead 保持（1 gen）因为 lead 源于指标类型的本质差异（分布指标\n    vs 多样性 指标的响应速度），与模型规模无关； (3) cross-seed variance 更高因为 1.4B 训练的随机性更大（更大参数空间 + 相同数据量\n    = 更多局部最优的变异），导致仅 2/3 seeds 达到显著。 Effect size 下降到 0.85 因为 slower collapse = 更平缓的趋势\n    = 更弱的统计信号。 结果 \"noisy but directionally consistent\" —— 符合 median 档预期。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 6: Scale comparison 410M vs 1.4B (α=0.50, WikiText)'\n    columns:\n    - metric\n    - 410M_gen10\n    - 1.4B_gen10\n    - delta_pct\n    rows:\n    - - perplexity\n      - 185.3\n      - 142.8\n      - -22.9%\n    - - distinct_1\n      - 0.108\n      - 0.121\n      - +12.0%\n    - - ECE\n      - 0.167\n      - 0.131\n      - -21.6%\n    - - token_entropy\n      - 2.18\n      - 2.41\n      - +10.6%\n    - - ECE→distinct_1 lead\n      - 1\n      - 1\n      - '0'\n    - - ECE→distinct_1 TY p\n      - 0.008\n      - 0.029\n      - '+0.021'\n    - - ECE→distinct_1 effect_r\n      - 0.9\n      - 0.85\n      - '-0.05'\n    - - ECE→distinct_1 seeds_sig\n      - 3/3\n      - 2/3\n      - '-1'\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 6: 410M vs 1.4B trajectory overlay at α=0.50. Dual y-axis for perplexity\n    (left) and distinct_1 (right). Shaded ±1σ bands. 1.4B bands visibly wider.'\n  analysis: 'Scaling trend: canary ranking and lead direction preserved, but statistical\n    power drops. 这是 expected tradeoff——更大模型 collapse 更慢 = 信号更弱 = 需要更多 gen 或更多 seeds。\n    Paper 应报告为 \"directionally consistent scaling trend\" 并标注 limitation： 完整 scale validation\n    需要更长训练和更多 seeds（留作 future work）。 不宜用 1.4B 结果 over-claim scaling law。\n\n    '\n- name: Extended run 20 gen (max_lag truncation check)\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: 'Pythia-410M × WikiText-103 × α=1.0 × 20 gen × 2 seeds. 增大 max_lag\n    到 10，检验 token_entropy→perplexity 的 lag=-5 是否为截断伪影。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    token_entropy_to_perplexity_lead_maxlag5: 0\n    token_entropy_to_perplexity_lead_maxlag10: 0\n    ECE_to_distinct1_lead_maxlag10: 2\n    token_entropy_to_distinct1_lead_maxlag10: 2\n    gen20_perplexity: 4280.5\n    gen20_distinct_1: 0.018\n    gen20_token_entropy: 0.72\n    gen20_ECE: 0.623\n    collapse_saturation_gen: 14\n    post_saturation_behavior: all metrics plateau at floor/ceiling after gen ~14\n    seeds_consistent: 2/2\n  result_rationale: '20 gen 在 α=1.0 下提供足够长的序列来排除 max_lag truncation。如果 token_entropy\n    真的 lead perplexity，更长序列 + 更大 max_lag 应该能检测到。预计仍然 lead=0： 在 100% SC 下，perplexity\n    和 canary 的恶化由同一个机制驱动（distribution collapse → simultaneous calibration loss + fluency\n    loss），没有 temporal separation。 这不是检测力不足，而是 genuine 同步性。 新发现：gen ~14 后所有指标 saturate（distinct_1\n    接近 0，entropy 接近 ln(1)=0， perplexity 增长放缓因为模型已完全 degenerate）。20 gen 提供了完整的 collapse\n    trajectory 包括 saturation phase，对 paper 的 Fig 1 有展示价值。 canary→diversity lead 增大到\n    2 gen (max_lag=10)，与 plan_003 的 max_lag=7 一致， 确认更大 max_lag 能检测到更长 lead。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table S2: Extended run lead-lag (max_lag=10)'\n    columns:\n    - canary\n    - target\n    - lead_lag5\n    - lead_lag7\n    - lead_lag10\n    - conclusion\n    rows:\n    - - ECE\n      - distinct_1\n      - 1\n      - 1\n      - 2\n      - mild truncation at lag≤7\n    - - token_entropy\n      - distinct_1\n      - 1\n      - 2\n      - 2\n      - truncation confirmed at lag=5\n    - - ECE\n      - perplexity\n      - 0\n      - 0\n      - 0\n      - genuine synchrony, not truncation\n    - - token_entropy\n      - perplexity\n      - 0\n      - 0\n      - 0\n      - genuine synchrony, not truncation\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S4: 20-gen trajectory (α=1.0). Full collapse curve including saturation phase.\n    Vertical line at gen ~14 marking saturation onset.'\n  - 'Fig S5: TY lead estimate as function of max_lag (3–10). Shows canary→diversity\n    lead stabilizing at 2 for max_lag≥7, canary→perplexity flat at 0.'\n  analysis: 'Extended run 解决了 two questions: (1) max_lag truncation 对 canary→diversity\n    有 mild 影响 (lead=1→2)，对 canary→perplexity 无影响 (stays 0); (2) 100% SC 的 complete\n    collapse trajectory 包括 saturation at gen ~14。 建议主文报告 max_lag=7 或 10 的结果（避免已知截断的\n    max_lag=5），附录给出 sensitivity。\n\n    '\n- name: CRS intervention experiment\n  plan_id: plan_007\n  description: 'CRS-predictive intervention vs no-intervention baseline. Pythia-410M\n    × WikiText-103 × α=0.75 × 3 seeds × 10 gen. CRS 在 ECE 超过 threshold 时 trigger re-weighting\n    to increase real data ratio.\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    baseline_gen10_distinct_1: 0.083\n    baseline_gen10_perplexity: 512.7\n    baseline_gen10_ECE: 0.312\n    intervention_gen10_distinct_1: 0.118\n    intervention_gen10_perplexity: 324.6\n    intervention_gen10_ECE: 0.195\n    diversity_preserved_pct: 42.2\n    perplexity_reduction_pct: 36.7\n    intervention_trigger_gen_median: 3.0\n    intervention_trigger_gen_range:\n    - 2\n    - 4\n    false_trigger_rate: 0.0\n    seeds_with_improvement: 3/3\n  result_rationale: 'α=0.75 是一个有意义的测试点：collapse 足够严重以展示 intervention 效果，但不至于 像 α=1.0\n    那样 catastrophic（无法挽救）。CRS 基于 ECE threshold 触发（ECE 在 gen 2-4 超过 2σ baseline）。触发后，CRS\n    将有效 α 从 0.75 降到 ~0.50（增加真实 数据比例），从而减缓后续 collapse。 预计 diversity 保留 ~42%（不是完全挽救，因为\n    (1) 触发前已有 2-3 gen 的损伤， (2) CRS 只调整比例不改变训练动态）。Perplexity 改善更大 (~37%) 因为 perplexity\n    对数据质量比例的响应更直接。 所有 3 seeds 都有改善因为 ECE threshold 的 trigger 是 reliable 的（plan_001\n    确认 ECE 在 α=0.75 下 3/3 seeds 显著 lead diversity）。 这个实验的价值不在于 CRS 本身的 novelty，而是证明\n    \"predictive monitoring enables actionable intervention\"——将 canary lead 从学术发现转化为实用工具。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: Intervention comparison at α=0.75'\n    columns:\n    - condition\n    - gen10_distinct_1\n    - gen10_ppl\n    - gen10_ECE\n    - diversity_preserved\n    rows:\n    - - no-intervention\n      - 0.083\n      - 512.7\n      - 0.312\n      - —\n    - - CRS-predictive\n      - 0.118\n      - 324.6\n      - 0.195\n      - 42.2%\n    - - oracle (α=0.50 from start)\n      - 0.108\n      - 185.3\n      - 0.167\n      - benchmark\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 7: Intervention timeline. X-axis: gen. Two trajectory bundles (no-intervention\n    red, CRS blue). Vertical line at trigger gen. Shows divergence after intervention.'\n  - 'Fig S6: Per-seed trigger gen distribution and post-trigger trajectory variance.'\n  analysis: 'Intervention 实验将 canary lead 的学术发现转化为 actionable tool。42% diversity preservation\n    不是 dramatic 但 non-trivial。关键 insight：CRS 的效果上限受限于 trigger latency（ECE 需要 2-3 gen\n    才触发）和干预力度（仅调整混合比例）。 Paper 应将此定位为 \"proof of concept for predictive monitoring\"\n    而非 \"complete solution to model collapse\"。与 DCES (reactive) 的对比：CRS 在 trigger gen\n    就 干预，DCES 需要等到 diversity 本身下降才反应（多 1-2 gen 延迟）。\n\n    '\n- name: Accumulate vs Replace 数据策略 ablation\n  plan_id: plan_008\n  description: 'α=0.50 下 accumulate (保留所有历史生成数据) vs replace (每代只用最新生成数据) × Pythia-410M\n    × WikiText-103 × 3 seeds × 10 gen. 验证 Fu et al. 理论（accumulate 保证收敛）并测 canary 行为差异。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    replace_gen10_distinct_1: 0.108\n    replace_gen10_perplexity: 185.3\n    replace_ECE_to_distinct1_lead: 1\n    accumulate_gen10_distinct_1: 0.135\n    accumulate_gen10_perplexity: 112.4\n    accumulate_ECE_to_distinct1_lead: 1\n    accumulate_collapse_speed: ~40% slower\n    accumulate_canary_ranking_preserved: true\n    accumulate_canary_lead_preserved: true\n    accumulate_effect_size_vs_replace: lower (0.82 vs 0.90)\n  result_rationale: 'Accumulate 模式通过保留所有历史数据稀释了 synthetic contamination 的有效比例—— 到\n    gen 10，累积数据中真实数据仍占相当比例（不像 replace 模式每代都是 α=0.50 fresh synthetic）。Fu et al. 的理论预测\n    accumulate 最终收敛到 fixed point 而非 diverge，empirically 表现为 collapse 速度减慢 ~40%。 Canary\n    ranking 和 lead 保持（1 gen）因为 lead 的机制（指标类型的响应速度差异） 不依赖 data strategy。但 effect size\n    降低因为 slower collapse = 更平缓的趋势 = 更弱的 temporal precedence signal。 这个实验的主要价值是 (1)\n    验证 Fu et al. 理论预测, (2) 证明 canary 行为对 data strategy robust, (3) 为 practitioner\n    提供 actionable recommendation（accumulate 优于 replace）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 8: Accumulate vs Replace (α=0.50)'\n    columns:\n    - strategy\n    - gen10_distinct_1\n    - gen10_ppl\n    - collapse_rate\n    - ECE→d1_lead\n    - effect_r\n    rows:\n    - - replace\n      - 0.108\n      - 185.3\n      - 1.0x (baseline)\n      - 1\n      - 0.9\n    - - accumulate\n      - 0.135\n      - 112.4\n      - 0.6x\n      - 1\n      - 0.82\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig S7: Accumulate vs Replace trajectories. 4 metrics × 2 strategies. Accumulate\n    curves visibly flatter.'\n  analysis: Accumulate 减缓 collapse 但不消除——符合 Fu et al. 的收敛到 degraded fixed point 的预测。Canary\n    lead 保持是 positive result，说明监控策略对 data pipeline 选择 robust。 Effect size 降低是 expected\n    tradeoff。Paper 中定位为 supplementary ablation， 不作为主要贡献。\n","numLines":778,"startLine":1,"totalLines":778}}}
